# dimensions v1.0.0

## Forms

### `(texture …)`

A texture and the view it is sampled through.

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:name` | `symbol` | yes | — | — |
| `:dimension` | `symbol enum` | no | — | one of: `1d`, `2d`, `3d` |
| `:view` | `symbol enum` | no | — | one of: `1d`, `2d` — 2D, `2d-array`, `cube`, `cube-array`, `3d` |

## Value kinds

### texture-dimension

GPUTextureDimension, spelled the way the WebGPU spec spells it.

Type: `symbol enum` — one of: `1d`, `2d`, `3d`.

### view-dimension

GPUTextureViewDimension: digit-leading and ordinary members in one set.

Type: `symbol enum` — one of: `1d`, `2d` — 2D, `2d-array`, `cube`, `cube-array`, `3d`.
